+  intro T θ Z hZZ εchild C₀ C₁ hC₀ hC₁ hzero hpos w σ freq height mesh hmesh hw hwm hweta hwL
+    hσlo hσhi hheight hfreq src hmatch hhi hMs hloSrc hhiSrc hcard hlowerSrc hupperSrc
